//api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/labels/A-UI","name":"A-UI","color":"c6a751","default":false,"description":"Graphical user interfaces, styles, layouts, and widgets"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-08-09T08:01:21Z","updated_at":"2023-10-26T22:28:24Z","closed_at":"2023-10-26T22:28:24Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bevy version\r\n\r\n0.11 & main\r\n\r\n## What you did\r\n```rust\r\nuse bevy::prelude::*;\r\n\r\nfn main() {\r\n    App::new()\r\n        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins)\r\n        .add_systems(Startup, setup)\r\n        .run();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfn setup(mut commands: Commands) {\r\n    commands.spawn(Camera2dBundle::default());\r\n    commands.spawn(\r\n        TextBundle::from_section(\r\n            format!(\" H\\nHH\"),\r\n            TextStyle::default(),\r\n        )\r\n        .with_text_alignment(TextAlignment::Right)\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What went wrong\r\n```\r\nthread 'Compute Task Pool (3)' panicked at 'min > max, or either was NaN. min = 15.000002, max = 10.000001'\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis bug was reported before on [discord](https://discord.com/channels/691052431525675048/1135561200739041361/1135561200739041361) but without a replication\r\n\r\n##  Additional Details\r\n\r\nThe horizontal bounds for right-aligned text containing spaces are calculated incorrectly. In the example above the space is counted twice causing the min-content-width to be larger than the max-content-width, causing a crash when the measure func attempts to clamp the available space.","closed_by":{"login":"alice-i-cecile","id":3579909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Nzk5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3579909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.g